on.","citation_ids":["cite.long.record-257bm-c11"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-c11"],"id":"long.record-257bm-c11","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.79 (Testing one nearest dyadic boundary)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.79, p. 67, label record:257bm-c11","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $d,E$ be nonnegative integers with $E\\le2^{d+1}$, and let\n$$\nj_*:=\\max\\{0\\le j\\le d:E\\le2^{d-j+1}\\}.\n$$\nThe boundary $2^{d-j_*+1}$ is the smallest power at least $E$ among the finite list $2,4,\\ldots,2^{d+1}$; in particular $j_*=d$ when $E\\le2$. The following conditions are equivalent:\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\n \\text{for every }0\\le j\\le d,\\quad\n 2^{d-j+1}<E\\ \\text{or}\\ E+2(d+j)\\le2^{d-j+1};\\\\\n E+2(d+j_*)\\le2^{d-j_*+1}.\n \\end{gathered}\n$$*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c11","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c11","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c11%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_critical_dyadic_band_index_eq_top_of_le_two%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c11%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_critical_dyadic_band_index_eq_top_of_le_two%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_critical_dyadic_band_index_eq_top_of_le_two"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c11","id":"sha256:72b1b